// spec: CLS-014
//
// A class may not inherit from itself, directly or through a chain.
//
// ⚠️ The direct case was always refused; a CYCLE was not, and ran silently,
// leaving a superclass chain with no end for FindMethod to walk.  Nothing
// noticed because a class could not be declared above its parent at all --
// hoisting [DCL-006] made the pair reachable, so the check had to grow from a
// self-reference to a cycle.

class A (B);
begin
end

class B (A);
begin
end
